## Browse

- [Breeds](<%= request.base_url %>/breeds): all <%= number_with_delimiter @counts[:breeds] %> breeds, each one a page carrying the API request that built it.
- [Groups](<%= request.base_url %>/groups): the <%= @counts[:groups] %> groups, every breed belonging to one of them.
- [Sitemap](<%= request.base_url %>/sitemap.xml): every page on the site.

